{"id":"vod_sn_36316","vodId":"36316","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"守护猫娘绯鞠","name_cn":"守护猫娘绯鞠","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0281c2cafa0990f3182f6cd42e979aba.jpg"},"summary":"天河优人（平川大辅 配音）是个独自生活孤苦伶仃的内向少年，对于生活，优人只希望能够平平安安的度过余生就好。可是事与愿违，在其16岁生日的那一天，一个名叫野井原绯鞠（小清水亚美 配音）的黑发女孩子出现在了他的面前，同时，亦有形状可怖的怪物对优人发起了攻击。　　战斗之后，绯鞠告诉惊魂未定的优人，他是“鬼斩役十二家”的后人。从前，在人妖混居的世界中，鬼斩役作为人类的守护者，发挥着坚实的作用。但随着时间的流转，他们的能力逐渐的减弱，最终，大部分鬼斩役都流落到了人界，成为了普通人中的一员。如今，妖怪的势力似乎有卷土重来之势，为此，优人必须鼓起勇气，为自己所爱的人不受伤害而努力战斗。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bitdTdYS0t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mTikHhVh7S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YX9j93f5JT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HeAUZXuNUz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TzXngNSt9i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2agbAYSf9x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WfKRpMZH1F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zPbn8mH6MW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7e8RU8yws41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MQ60b4DtPb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FFhUDVxH0d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vHz1At89H31/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:24.177Z"}